@startuml 궁합요청_수락_시퀀스

autonumber

actor "UserB(대상자)" as UB
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "CompatibilityController\n(Flask API)" as CC
participant "CompatibilityService" as CS
database "DatabaseManager" as DB
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC

UB -> F: 궁합 요청 수락
F -> CC: POST /api/v1/compatibility/requests/{id}/accept (auth)
CC -> CS: accept_request(request_id, target_id)
CS -> DB: SELECT request, requester_saju, target_saju
DB --> CS: saju1, saju2, gender1, gender2
CS -> SC: calculate_compatibility(saju1, saju2, gender1, gender2)
SC --> CS: { original, final, stress }
CS -> DB: UPDATE requests SET status='accepted',\n result={...}
DB --> CS: ok
CS --> CC: { compatibility_result, status }
CC --> F: 200 OK JSON
F --> UB: 결과 화면 표시

@enduml


